  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/IMG_5074.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El guitarrista Jes&uacute;s de Vicente y La Meligrana a la voz, con la compa&ntilde;&iacute;a al caj&oacute;n del cu&ntilde;ado y hermano repsectivo, han llenado la noche-madrugada de este s&aacute;bado de flamenco el pub El Patio Andaluz, de la calle Ingeniero Echegaray, 20 de Onda.<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/video.php?v=293133847544108&amp;set=vb.100005424841813&amp;type=2&amp;theater\" target=\"_blank\"> Al final del concierto, De Vicente ha hecho d&uacute;o con su alumno aventajado en el Conservatorio de Onda Llu&iacute;s Casta&ntilde; Fern&aacute;ndez</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/devicentemeligranapatioandaluz/img_5073.jpg\" alt=\"img_5073\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/devicentemeligranapatioandaluz/img_5074.jpg\" alt=\"img_5074\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/devicentemeligranapatioandaluz/img_5075.jpg\" alt=\"img_5075\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/devicentemeligranapatioandaluz/img_5076.jpg\" alt=\"img_5076\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/devicentemeligranapatioandaluz/img_5080.jpg\" alt=\"img_5080\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/devicentemeligranapatioandaluz/img_5081.jpg\" alt=\"img_5081\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
